      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We apply laser puncture to influence biological active points with infra red laser ionizing at scheme with effect of treatment of asthma bronchial with chronic accompanied by rhino sinusitis. The clinical effectiveness of treatment was seen in positive dynamics of clinical, instrumental and spirographycal indices regarding bronchial asthma and concomitant rhinitis as well, which was confirmed by X-ray examination. Application of laser punctureto treat the elderly patients with asthma bronchial accompanied by rhino sinusitis is an effective method having no side effects that can be used in an ambulatory and in a hospital."},
